The server state should follow this structure:

- bans
    - users (list)
    - ids (list)
    - ips (list)

- whitelists
    - active (bool)
    - users (list)
    - ips (list)
    - ips (list)

- max players (int)

- users (dict)
    - id (str - key)
    - data (Player - value)
        - username (str)
        - coordinates (Vector3)
        - cappy data (dict OR empty dict, depending on if Cappy is out or not)
            (can also be Cappy object)
            - cappy anim (str)
            - cappy coords (Vector3)
            - cappy rot (Quaternion)

